class Ui5ExpandableText(Component):
    """### Overview The `ui5-expandable-text` component allows displaying a large body of text in a small space. It provides an "expand/collapse" functionality, which shows/hides potentially truncated text. ### Usage #### When to use: - To accommodate long texts in limited space, for example in list items, table cell texts, or forms #### When not to use: - The content is critical for the user. In this case use short descriptions that can fit in - Strive to provide short and meaningful texts to avoid excessive number of "Show More" links on the page ### Responsive Behavior On phones, if the component is configured to display the full text in a popover, the popover will appear in full screen. ### ES6 Module Import `import "@ui5/webcomponents/dist/ExpandableText";`"""

